      ├─ 💤 publish.yml, Xs in action, Xs watched
      ├─ 💤 publish.yml, Xs in action, Xs watched
      ├─ 💤 publish.yml, Xs in action, Xs watched
      └─ ✨ done! publish.yml, Xm Ys in action, Xs watched
"
`;

exports[`git.release.p6.timing positive: accurate duration from timestamps given: [case1] PR inflight then merges with known timestamps when: [t0] --watch is called then: it shows duration from completedAt - startedAt, not now - startedAt 1`] = `
"🐢 heres the wave...

🐚 git.release --into main --watch

🌊 release: feat(ocean): add surfboards
   ├─ 🐢 1 check(s) in progress
   ├─ 🌴 automerge unfound (use --apply to add)
