      ├─ 💤 1 left, Xs in action, Xs watched
      ├─ 💤 1 left, Xs in action, Xs watched
      ├─ 💤 1 left, Xs in action, Xs watched
      ├─ ... (Nx more)
      └─ ✨ done! Xm Ys in action, Xs watched
"
`;

exports[`git.release.p6.timing positive: accurate duration from timestamps given: [case2] tag workflow completed with known timestamps when: [t0] --watch --into prod --from main is called then: it shows duration from updatedAt - startedAt 1`] = `
